{
 "name": "R1-06-core-early-stop-drops-last-head-silently",
 "note": "ann invites bea twice (g1, g2) and bea accepts both. ann stops g1 having seen bea's answer, and stops g2 without having seen her answer (it comes before the answer: she never held g2). Bea's only head is then g1, which the first stop ended, so circles.md Removed says she is out with that stop's counted_to (null). Oracle: removed has bea. Core (fold.rs:1230-1243): the early stop deletes head g2 and shifts bea out of members, but nothing pushes her into `ends` (the first stop saw a live head g2 and did not either), so she is in neither members nor removed.",
